00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:35.340
Kenapa ?

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:41.660
Aku mengaktifkan kartu mantraku Amazing Pendulum dari tanganku !

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:43.450
Saat tak ada kartu di Pendulum Zonesku ,

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:47.660
